    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kevin Beirne Auctioneers is delighted to present No.11 Cois Na Habhann, Belcarra , Co. Mayo, a spacious three-bedroom end-of-terrace residence located in the heart of the popular village of Belcarra.\n\nThis well-maintained family home enjoys a generous site with side access and a large enclosed rear garden. A unique feature of the property is the double gated rear entrance, providing secure off-street parking and easy access to the rear of the house.\n\nIdeally situated within walking distance of all village amenities including Belcarra National School, church, shop, butcher, pubs and a range of scenic countryside walks, the property is also just a 10-minute drive from Castlebar Town Centre and is within easy reach of Castlebar Golf Club.\n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\nBright entrance hall with laminate flooring.\n\nHome Office (10ft x 12ft)\nSpacious office with laminate flooring, internet connection, ample power points, blinds and window overlooking the front garden.\n\nBedroom 1 (12ft x 14ft)\nDouble bedroom with laminate flooring, fitted wardrobe, twin windows with curtains and blinds.\n\nGuest WC\nFully tiled with WC, WHB, vanity unit and mirror.\n\nKitchen/Dining/Living Area (Approx. 28ft x 24ft)\nA superb open-plan living space featuring:\n\nModern fitted kitchen with integrated dishwasher.\nElectric oven and hob.\nLarge fridge freezer.\nCeramic tiled kitchen floor.\nSpacious dining area.\nOpen gas fireplace with cast iron inset and timber mantelpiece.\nTV point.\nDouble patio doors opening onto a balcony overlooking the surrounding countryside.\n\nUtility Room\nPlumbed for washing machine and dryer with sink, extractor fan, tiled floor and additional storage.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nLanding\nCarpeted stairs and landing with hot press.\n\nBedroom 2 (15ft x 12ft)\nLarge double bedroom with laminate flooring and blinds.\n\nFamily Bathroom (12ft x 10ft)\nFully tiled with corner bath, separate Mira electric shower, vanity unit, WC and WHB.\n\nMaster Bedroom\nSpacious master bedroom with laminate flooring, fitted his-and-hers wardrobes, curtains and ensuite.\n\nEnsuite\nFully tiled with Mira electric shower, vanity unit, WC, WHB, mirror and storage press.\n\nBedroom 3 (12ft x 12ft)\nDouble bedroom with laminate flooring and direct access to the rear garden.\n\n\nThis is an ideal family home or investment property in a highly sought-after village location, offering spacious accommodation, excellent outdoor space and convenient access to Castlebar and all local amenities."
      },
